{"id": "68152", "title": "婚颤", "author": "孤山一梦", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 17, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68152.htm", "intro": "陈哉最见不得邯墨衣冠楚楚，推着眼镜的模样。戴着眼镜他是大状，摘了眼镜他就是流氓！\r\n陈哉一法盲VS邯墨一大状    （离婚or不离婚）\r\n世界上最坑爹的婆媳关系是什么？\r\n问陈哉，陈哉必答：我是写网络言情小说的！我丈夫的妈偏是个初中语文老师兼年级组长，就爱没收学生手里的言情小说！！！\r\n网文媳妇对上语文老师的婆婆   （离婚or不离婚）\r\n这世界上有寒颤，有冷颤，有心肝儿颤，还有一个……叫婚颤……", "base": "files/article/html/68/68152", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10511146.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10511147.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10511148.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-22", "file": "10511149.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23-28", "file": "10511150.html", "available": false}, {"title": "29-34", "file": "10511151.html", "available": false}, {"title": "35-38", "file": "10511152.html", "available": false}, {"title": "39-43", "file": "10511153.html", "available": false}, {"title": "44-50", "file": "10511154.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-56", "file": "10511155.html", "available": false}, {"title": "57-62", "file": "10511156.html", "available": false}, {"title": "63-70", "file": "10511157.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-76", "file": "10511158.html", "available": false}, {"title": "77-81", "file": "10511159.html", "available": false}, {"title": "82-90", "file": "10511160.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-97", "file": "10511161.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10511162.html", "available": false}]}